# Bright Data Collector Conventions

- Never expose hardcoded API keys or Scraper IDs in scraper source files.
- Read credentials from `backend/app/config.py`.
- Keep mock simulator routines separated so testing can occur without hitting live scraper endpoints.
- If selectors or response structures are modified, test validation errors using the `inject_errors` switch in the tests.
